mitations?\",\"content\":\"Inform guide in advance. We accommodate various fitness levels. Alternative activities or rest options available.\"},{\"title\":\"Good for families?\",\"content\":\"Yes! Designed for all ages and fitness levels. Children enjoy the experience. Parents appreciate professional guide and safety.\"}]','publish',NULL,'7',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-05-26 00:40:14','2026-05-26 00:40:14','1','0',NULL,NULL,NULL,'[{\"title\":\"Professional guide\"},{\"title\":\"All meals\"},{\"title\":\"Water & refreshments\"},{\"title\":\"Transportation\"},{\"title\":\"Safety equipment\"},{\"title\":\"All mentioned facilities\"}]','[{\"title\":\"Alcohol\"},{\"title\":\"Tips\\/gratuities\"},{\"title\":\"Personal items\"},{\"title\":\"Equipment rental\"},{\"title\":\"Travel insurance\"}]','[{\"title\":\"Day 1: Angel\'s Flight \\u2014 Scenic Fixed-Wing Flight\",\"desc\":\"Scenic fixed-wing flight over Victoria Falls \\u2014 a sweeping bird\'s-eye view of Mosi-oa-Tunya from above.\",\"content\":\"7am breakfast & briefing \\u2022 8am-10am morning activity \\u2022 10-10:30am rest break \\u2022 10:30am-12:30pm continue activity \\u2022 12:30-1:30pm lunch \\u2022 1:30-3pm afternoon activity \\u2022 3-3:30pm rest break \\u2022 3:30-5pm final activity \\u2022 5-5:30pm debrief & return\",\"image_id\":null}]',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'7',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'0');
