lking shoes, sun protection, hat, camera, water bottle, notebook, personal medications, appropriate clothing.\"},{\"title\":\"Can I customize?\",\"content\":\"Core itinerary is set for safety and quality. Ask guide about variations or additional photo stops within schedule.\"},{\"title\":\"Physical limitations?\",\"content\":\"Inform guide in advance. We accommodate various fitness levels. Alternative activities or rest options available.\"},{\"title\":\"Good for families?\",\"content\":\"Yes! Designed for all ages and fitness levels. Children enjoy the experience. Parents appreciate professional guide and safety.\"}]','publish',NULL,'9',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-05-31 16:01:45','2026-05-31 16:01:45','1','0',NULL,NULL,NULL,'[{\"title\":\"Professional guide\"},{\"title\":\"All meals\"},{\"title\":\"Water & refreshments\"},{\"title\":\"Transportation\"},{\"title\":\"Safety equipment\"},{\"title\":\"All mentioned facilities\"}]','[{\"title\":\"Alcohol\"},{\"title\":\"Tips\\/gratuities\"},{\"title\":\"Personal items\"},{\"title\":\"Equipment rental\"},{\"title\":\"Travel insurance\"}]','[{\"title\":\"Day 1: Tarangire game drive (arrival day)\",\"desc\":\"Tarangire game drive (arrival day) - Wildlife safari in Tarangire National Park. Tarangire National Park After breakfast, depart for Tarangire National Park ...\",\"content\":\"7am breakfast & briefing \\u2022 8am-10am morning activity \\u2022 10-10:30am rest break \\u2022 10:30am-12:30pm continue activity \\u2022 12:30-1:30pm lunch \\u2022 1:30-3pm afternoon activity \\u2022 3-3:30pm rest break \\u2022 3:30-5pm final activity \\u2022 5-5:30pm debrief & return\",\"image_id\":null}]',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'9',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'0');
