 Lodging: Serengeti Medium Camp (or similar) — 3 nights</p>',NULL,NULL,'Hadzabe hunter-gatherer experience - Cultural experience in Lake Eyasi. Hadzabe People After breakfast, take an afternoon hike to meet the Hadzabe people.','4','19','Lake Eyasi',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'295.00',NULL,'10','1','2',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[{\"title\":\"What\'s included?\",\"content\":\"Professional guide, all meals, transportation, water, and access to all facilities mentioned in the itinerary.\"},{\"title\":\"What should I bring?\",\"content\":\"Comfortable walking shoes, sun protection, hat, camera, water bottle, notebook, personal medications, appropriate clothing.\"},{\"title\":\"Can I customize?\",\"content\":\"Core itinerary is set for safety and quality. Ask guide about variations or additional photo stops within schedule.\"},{\"title\":\"Physical limitations?\",\"content\":\"Inform guide in advance. We accommodate various fitness levels. Alternative activities or rest options available.\"},{\"title\":\"Good for families?\",\"content\":\"Yes! Designed for all ages and fitness levels. Children enjoy the experience. Parents appreciate professional guide and safety.\"}]','publish',NULL,'9',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-05-31 16:01:45','2026-05-31 16:01:45','1','0',NULL,NULL,NULL,'[{\"title\":\"Professional guide\"},{\"title\":\"All meals\"},{\"title\":\"Water & refreshments\"},{\"title\":\"Transportation\"},{\"title\":\"Safety equipment\"},{\"title\":\"All mentioned facilities\"}]','[{\"title\":\"Alcohol\"},{\"title\":\"Tips\\/gratuities\"},{\"title\":\"Personal items\"},{\"title\":\"Equipment rental\"},{\"title\":\"Travel insurance\"}]','[{\"title\":\"Day 1: Hadzabe hunter-gatherer experience\",\"desc\":\"Hadzabe hunter-gatherer experience - Cultural experience in Lake Eyasi. Hadzabe People After breakfast, take an afternoon hike to meet the Hadzabe people.\",\"content\":\"7am breakfast & briefing \\u2022 8am-10am morning activity \\u2022 10-10:30am rest break \\u2022